WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
BUILD 003. THEY HAVE INFORMATION.. But they still cannot reliably decide what to do.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
LOOK FOR. THE UNRESOLVED DECISION.. Name the recurring choice—not the content category around it.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
TEST THE GAP. RECURRENCE · CONSEQUENCE · AMBIGUITY · FRAGMENTATION. Four signals make the missing decision structure inspectable.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
DO NOT CLAIM. A SCORE IS NOT DEMAND.. It does not prove willingness to pay, product-market fit or solution correctness.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
THE OPPORTUNITY. BUILD THE DECISION PATH.. Turn scattered information into an accountable way to choose and act.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
SAVE THIS. FIND THE DECISION PEOPLE STILL CANNOT MAKE.. Then investigate whether a system—not more content—is what is missing.

